{"id":"proprium.dominica-ii-adventus-postcommunio","title":"Repléti cibo spirituális alimóniæ","category":"proprium","section":"missa-fidelium","variant":"dominica-ii-adventus","sung":false,"st":"working-edition","ad":5,"adw":6,"about":{"pl":"Modlitwa po Komunii II Niedzieli Adwentu. Nie prosi o nic nowego, lecz o to, by przyjęty pokarm zmienił sąd o rzeczach: czym gardzić, a co miłować.","en":"The postcommunion of the Second Sunday of Advent. It asks for nothing new, but that the food just received should change the judgment of things — what to despise and what to love."},"seg":[{"id":"s01","type":"verse","speaker":"sacerdos","voice":"clara","w":[{"i":"w001","f":"Repléti","l":"repleo","m":327,"h":"w008"},{"i":"w002","f":"cibo","l":"cibus","m":29},{"i":"w003","f":"spirituális","l":"spiritualis","m":14,"h":"w004"},{"i":"w004","f":"alimóniæ","l":"alimonia","p":",","m":64},{"i":"w005","f":"súpplices","l":"supplex","m":87,"h":"w008"},{"i":"w006","f":"te","l":"tu","p":",","m":4},{"i":"w007","f":"Dómine","l":"dominus","p":",","m":5},{"i":"w008","f":"deprecámur","l":"deprecor","p":":","m":238},{"i":"w009","f":"ut","l":"ut","m":15},{"i":"w010","f":"huius","l":"hic","m":121},{"i":"w011","f":"participatióne","l":"participatio","m":45},{"i":"w012","f":"mystérii","l":"mysterium","p":",","m":68},{"i":"w013","f":"dóceas","l":"doceo","m":300},{"i":"w014","f":"nos","l":"nos","m":49},{"i":"w015","f":"terréna","l":"terrenus","m":129,"s":true},{"i":"w016","f":"despícere","l":"despicio","m":222},{"i":"w017","f":"et","l":"et","m":15},{"i":"w018","f":"amáre","l":"amo","m":229},{"i":"w019","f":"cæléstia","l":"caelestis","p":".","m":129,"s":true},{"i":"w020","f":"Per","l":"per","m":3,"h":"w021"},{"i":"w021","f":"Dóminum","l":"dominus","p":".","m":35}],"tr":{"pl":"Napełnieni duchowym pokarmem, pokornie Cię prosimy, Panie: przez udział w tym misterium naucz nas gardzić sprawami ziemskimi i miłować dobra niebieskie. Przez Pana.","en":"Filled with spiritual food, we humbly ask You, Lord: through our sharing in this mystery, teach us to despise what is earthly and to love what is heavenly. Through the Lord."},"g":{"pl":["napełnieni","pokarmem","duchowego","pożywienia","błagający","Ciebie","Panie","prosimy","abyś","tego","uczestnictwem","misterium","nauczył","nas","ziemskimi","gardzić","i","miłować","niebieskie","przez","Pana"],"en":["filled","with the food","of spiritual","nourishment","suppliant","Thee","Lord","we beseech","that","of this","by the partaking","mystery","Thou wouldst teach","us","earthly things","to despise","and","to love","heavenly things","Through","the Lord"]}}]}